       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the usual maximum for ibuprofen.\n\n- **Per dose:** 1600 mg is double the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Per day:** 6,400 mg is double the maximum prescription dose of 3,200 mg/day. Over-the-counter use is capped at 1,200 mg/day.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events. Normal kidney and liver function doesn't remove these risks.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions.\n- **400\u2013600 mg PO every 6 hours** (1,600\u20132,400 mg/day), for typical analgesia.\n- **1600 mg total daily**, for example 400 mg four times daily.\n\nIf you do want the dose as written, tell me the clinical rationale and I'll enter it with a note. Otherwise, tell me the corrected dose and frequency and I'll enter it right away."
      }
